.TH WERKMEISTER-FEATURE-STATUS 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-feature\-status \- Show all features, services, resource usage
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister feature status\fR
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-v, \-\-verbose\fR
Show individual container details
.TP
\fB\-\-intercepts\fR
Show Telepresence intercept state only (per feature service; cheap — skips docker and k8s probes).
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output structured JSON (useful for agent\-driven diagnosis)
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
\fBOutput example:\fR
.PP
.nf
.RS 4
  Slot  Feature         Services                          Ports          Status
  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  1     my\-feature      backend, frontend            11100\-11119    up (2/2)
  3     other\-feature   frontend                        11300\-11319    partial (0/1)

  2 active feature(s), 10 slot(s) available
.RE
.fi
.PP
\fBStatus indicators:\fR
.IP \(bu 3
\fBup (N/M)\fR (green) — all containers running
.IP \(bu 3
\fBpartial (N/M)\fR (yellow) — some containers running
.IP \(bu 3
\fBdown (0/M)\fR (red) — no containers running
.IP \(bu 3
\fBno containers\fR (dim) — compose file exists but no containers found
.PP
\fB`\-\-k8s`\fR checks only the k8s port\-forwards container. Checks the Docker container health of \fBw9r\-k8s\-forwards\fR and reports the status of each forwarded port:
.PP
.nf
.RS 4
  Container: w9r\-k8s\-forwards    Status: healthy

  Service                Port   k8s Target                            Status
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  redis                  9050   default/redis:6379                    healthy
  postgres               9051   default/postgres:5432                 healthy
  backend             9052   default/backend:80                 healthy
  redis                  9050   dev:6379                              healthy
  frontend             9053   default/frontend:8080               down

  11/12 healthy, 1 down
  Run 'werkmeister infra connect \-\-k8s' to restart the k8s\-forwards container
.RE
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
